# A1: the AUDITED eight-seat 262k attach on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-u1-audit (the lever audits of -best-audit plus QWEN_FAST_TP4_RS_UNIT_MAJOR=1 and QWEN_FAST_TP4_RS_UNIT_MAJOR_AUDIT=1). Tests: concurrent8_steady (the
# quad blocks' mix: both 64-row blocks live) and concurrent8_code_32k (eight real coding users at 32k). READ in this order and stop at the first failure: (1) admission passed at capacity 262144 and the reservation installed;
# (2) '[PINDIAG] tp4 u1 engaged rows=64 calls=128 unit_major=128 fallbacks=0' once per captured forward (the warm forward and each block's capture): a fall-back line or unit_major=0 is the finding; (3) ZERO
# '[PINDIAG] tp4 u1 audit mismatch' lines and an '[PINDIAG] tp4 u1 audit shape=64x5120 ... exact=True' line from the warm forward (round=0) and from the first replays of each block (c2_smoke_check requires one for every served shape);
# (4) every other audit of the profile zero mismatches; (5) every answer's hash equal to S0c's and the accepted tokens and verify rounds equal (the lever must not move one token). Duration (estimate): 100 min. Stop rule.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/u1 development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/u1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-u1-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/u1 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-u1-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-u1-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k
